jobs.description:
The perfect part-time job: early mornings, early finishes! ☀️ You’ll earn a great hourly wage of €16,78 per hour and work part-time shifts in the mornings. Come join Royal FloraHolland in Honselersdijk as an orderpicker and start your day surrounded by flowers! 💐

What we offer
- Hourly wage of €16,60 per hour
- Get €0,18 extra allowance. You'll get €16,78 p/h💸
- Possibility of a permanent contract
- Travel allowance or public transport subscription
- Participation in staff association & fun events!
- Enjoy free flowers up to 5 times a year! 💐

Who you are
To keep the warehouse running smoothly, it’s important you meet the following requirements as an orderpicker:

- You are available 1 to 5 days per week;
- You are available on Mondays;
- You are available for shifts starting at 05:45 and ending between 09:30 and 12:00;
- You have your own place to stay in The Netherlands;
- You are available at least till October;
- You are at least 1.65 meters tall;
- You speak Dutch or English;
- You are willing to work in Honselersdijk.

What will you do
Your morning as orderpicker at Royal FloraHolland starts bright and early! At 05:45 you’re already in the warehouse. Ready for another day surrounded by flowers! 🌸 Because you start early, you’re usually done somewhere between 09:30 and 12:00. That means plenty of free time in the afternoon for yourself! ☀️

With an electric tractor you cruise through the large halls. Hunting down all the flowers and plants on your pick list. You’re constantly on the move, which makes your job so active! Once your order is complete, you drop it off at the right department and grab a new empty cart. This keeps you moving and before you know it… Your shift is over! And that little tug vehicle? You get a full explanation of how it works on your first workday! 🚀

